{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Premise</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summer is coming, and you remember all the interesting moments you lived this year at school\u2026 that fight in the mud, the organized attack on the kitchen, when we wrecked the teacher\u2019s car, among others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relive these adventures one last time with your friends in this Party Game, where you take on the role of a kid with superpowers who just wants\u00a0to\u00a0have\u00a0fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219680/extras/8bd557cc5b66946b322d2e0df3809d6d.poster.avif?t=1754200532\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219680/extras/8bd557cc5b66946b322d2e0df3809d6d.webm?t=1754200532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219680/extras/8bd557cc5b66946b322d2e0df3809d6d.mp4?t=1754200532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your style with different skins you can use to show off to your friends that you\u2019re better than them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Expand the Playground</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you run out of things to do at school, you\u2019ll unlock new games in different locations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219680/extras/07c858bcbef130810f99b2f2c68624b7.poster.avif?t=1754200532\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219680/extras/07c858bcbef130810f99b2f2c68624b7.webm?t=1754200532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219680/extras/07c858bcbef130810f99b2f2c68624b7.mp4?t=1754200532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use objects found on the map during the match, like milk bottles to boost yourself, chili peppers to burn your enemies, potions to turn into a giant, and more gameplay variations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since it\u2019s a party game, there are tons of mini-games to enjoy\u00a0and\u00a0master!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3219680?t=1754200532","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219680/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754200532","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219680/2562389e0e0e88317430dcc7c2e49132a4b2c9b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754200532","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219680/2562389e0e0e88317430dcc7c2e49132a4b2c9b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754200532","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Premise</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summer is coming, and you remember all the interesting moments you lived this year at school\u2026 that fight in the mud, the organized attack on the kitchen, when we wrecked the teacher\u2019s car, among others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relive these adventures one last time with your friends in this Party Game, where you take on the role of a kid with superpowers who ju